Z||000000||fieroX||12-08-2001||07:04 PM||||I cant find this info anywhere, what is the stock tire size for the 14" rim?  Im trying to figure out what size tire I need for my 17s.  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif">  </A><BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroX.com</A><BR>coming soon L67 powered 87 coupe||||reg||1
Z||000001||JohnF||12-08-2001||07:43 PM||||There were several different "stock" tire sizes for the 14" delivered from the factory (and even dealer).  It had to do with year, model, engines and even personal preferences.  Different tire sizes could be ordered.<P>All in all, what has this got to do with 17" rims?  Check out this forum for many suggestions and sizes of 17".  <P>This is along way from "stock".<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=56509969&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||avengador1||12-08-2001||08:06 PM||||You can try <A HREF="http://www.tirerack.com" TARGET=_blank>www.tirerack.com</A>  to get plus size wheel and tire suggestions. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Reality||12-08-2001||08:15 PM||||As stated before depended on model and year but the stock configurations are as follows.<P>84-85 SE/GT P215/60R 14<BR>86 Coupe/SC P185/75R 14<BR>86-87 SE P195/70R 14<BR>87-88 Coupe/SC P185/75R 14<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/realitysignature_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
